OL,3,GNEWSAAbout 230 jobs at risk at
OL,4,Acash-strapped council
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 230 jobs are at risk at a
OL,7,Fcash-strapped Cheshire council, with up
OL,8,Fto 100 roles set to be lost in adult
OL,9,Fsocial care.
OL,11,FWarrington Council said it needed to
OL,12,Fmake an extra #50m of savings - on top
OL,13,Fof #40m worth of cuts already approved.
OL,15,FThe council has faced financial issues
OL,16,Fin recent years, including building up
OL,17,F#1.8bn of debt which led to the
OL,18,Fgovernment appointing ministerial
OL,19,Fenvoys to oversee the way the authority
OL,20,Fis run.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
